msgstr ""
"ຈັກສີດຢາແບບແບັດເຕີຣີ ເປັນອຸປະກອນເຮັດສວນທີ່ພົກພາງ່າຍ ແລະ ມີປະສິດທິພາບ, ບໍ່ຕ້ອງອອກແຮງໂຍກດ້ວຍມື, ຊ່ວຍ"
"ໃຫ້ການສີດພົ່ນນ້ຳຢາສະດວກສະບາຍຂຶ້ນ. ເໝາະສຳລັບວຽກງານຫຼາກຫຼາຍ ເຊັ່ນ: ການດູແລພືດ ແລະ ການທຳຄວາມສະ"
"ອາດ, ແບັດເຕີຣີສາມາດສາກໄຟໄດ້ ພ້ອມຫົວສີດທີ່ປັບໄດ້ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ງ່າຍດາຍ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.template,description_sale:agriculture_shop.product_product_19_product_template
msgid ""
"The Mild Steel Shaver Machine is a powerful tool for precision metal shaping "
"and smoothing. With a sturdy build and adaptable features, it efficiently "
"shaves mild steel surfaces, achieving smooth finishes for various industrial "
"and crafting applications."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງຂູດຜິວເຫຼັກກ້າອ່ອນ ເປັນເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງ ສຳລັບການຂຶ້ນຮູບ ແລະ ຕົກແຕ່ງຜິວໂລຫະໃຫ້ລຽບນຽນ. ດ້ວ"
"ຍໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ແຂງແຮງ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້, ມັນສາມາດຂູດຜິວເຫຼັກກ້າອ່ອນໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ, ໃຫ້ຜິວງານທີ່ລຽບງາ"
"ມ ສຳລັບວຽກອຸດສາຫະກຳ ແລະ ງານຊ່າງຕ່າງໆ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.template,description_sale:agriculture_shop.product_product_21_product_template
msgid ""
"The Shredding Machine is a robust device designed for efficiently breaking "
"down materials into smaller, manageable pieces. Whether it's paper, plastic, "
"or other materials, this machine offers quick and effective shredding, "
"enhancing waste management and data security processes."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງບົດຍ່ອຍ ເປັນອຸປະກອນທີ່ແຂງແຮງ ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອບົດຍ່ອຍວັດສະດຸໃຫ້ເປັນຕ່ອນນ້ອຍໆໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ. ບໍ່"
"ວ່າຈະເປັນເຈ້ຍ, ພລາສຕິກ, ຫຼື ວັດສະດຸອື່ນໆ, ເຄື່ອງນີ້ສາມາດບົດຍ່ອຍໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ, ຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງຂະບວນການຈັດກ"
"ານສິ່ງເສດເຫຼືອ ແລະ ຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.template,description_sale:agriculture_shop.product_product_13_product_template
msgid ""
"The Soil Activator is a natural solution that boosts soil health and plant "
"growth. Packed with beneficial microorganisms and nutrients, it revitalizes "
"the soil ecosystem, promoting better nutrient absorption and stronger, more "
"vibrant plants."
msgstr ""
"ສານປັບປຸງດິນ ເປັນສານລະລາຍທຳມະຊາດທີ່ຊ່ວຍຟື້ນຟູຄວາມອຸດົມສົມບູນຂອງດິນ ແລະ ເລັ່ງການຈະເລີນເຕີບໂຕຂອງພື"
"ດ. ອຸດົມໄປດ້ວຍຈຸລິນຊີ ແລະ ທາດອາຫານທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດ, ຊ່ວຍຟື້ນຟູລະບົບນິເວດໃນດິນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ພືດດູດຊຶມທາດອາຫານ"
"ໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ເຕີບໃຫຍ່ຢ່າງແຂງແຮງ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.template,description_sale:agriculture_shop.product_product_20_product_template
msgid ""
"The hand sickle is a compact and versatile cutting tool with a curved blade, "
"designed for efficient and precise trimming of plants, grasses, and crops. "
"Its ergonomic handle and sharp blade make it a handy instrument for "
"gardening and agricultural tasks, ensuring clean and effortless cuts with "
"every use."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ຽວຫຍ້າ ເປັນເຄື່ອງມືຕັດຂະໜາດກະທັດຮັດທີ່ມີໃບມີດໂຄ້ງ, ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຕັດແຕ່ງຕົ້ນໄມ້, ຫຍ້າ ແລະ ຜົນລະປູກໄດ້"
"ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ ແລະ ຊັດເຈນ. ດ້າມຈັບຖືກອອກແບບໃຫ້ຈັບສະບາຍມື ພ້ອມໃບມີດທີ່ຄົມກຣິດ, ເໝາະສຳລັບວຽກສວນ ແລ"
"ະ ວຽກກະສິກຳ, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຕັດໄດ້ງ່າຍດາຍທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ໃຊ້ງານ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.red_revolution_tomato_seeds
msgid ""
"The result is a batch of premium organic tomato seeds, ready to be shared "
"with growers and gardeners who are committed to cultivating delicious, "
"nutritious, and environmentally friendly tomato plants.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຄື ຊຸດແກ່ນໝາກເລັ່ນອິນຊີຄຸນນະພາບສູງ, ພ້ອມສົ່ງຕໍ່ໃຫ້ກັບຊາວກະສິກອນ ແລະ ຊາວສວນ ທີ່ມີຄວາມຕັ້ງໃຈໃນກ"
"ານປູກໝາກເລັ່ນທີ່ແຊບ, ມີຄຸນຄ່າທາງອາຫານ ແລະ ເປັນມິດຕໍ່ສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມ.<br/>"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.attribute.value,name:agriculture_shop.product_attribute_value_10
msgid "TheBestBrand"
msgstr "TheBestBrand"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"These tools allow you to manage your sales strategy and customer "
"interactions effectively:"
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງມືເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຄຸ້ມຄອງຍຸດທະສາດການຂາຍ ແລະ ການພົວພັນກັບລູກຄ້າໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ:"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.template,name:agriculture_shop.product_product_14_product_template
msgid "Thiram - Pesticide"
msgstr "Thiram - ຢາປາບສັດຕູພືດ"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.template,description_sale:agriculture_shop.product_product_14_product_template
msgid ""
"Thiram is an effective pesticide renowned for its broad-spectrum protection "
"against fungi and pests. Applied to plants, it forms a barrier, defending "
"crops and promoting robust and thriving vegetation."
msgstr ""
"Thiram ເປັນຢາປາບສັດຕູພືດທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງ ໂດດເດັ່ນໃນການປ້ອງກັນເຊື້ອຣາ ແລະ ສັດຕູພືດໄດ້ຢ່າງກວ້າງຂວາ"
"ງ. ເມື່ອນຳໄປສີດພົ່ນ, ມັນຈະສ້າງຊັ້ນປ້ອງກັນພືດຜົນ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພືດຈະເລີນເຕີບໂຕໄດ້ຢ່າງແຂງແຮງ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This solution is designed to manage every aspect of\n"
"            agricultural retail, supporting both <b>B2B and B2C sales</b> of "
"farming products. It\n"
"            covers <b>Point of Sale (POS) and website</b> operations, "
"offering organized categories\n"
"            like <b>seeds, pesticides, nutrition, and equipment</b>."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບນີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຄຸ້ມຄອງທຸກດ້ານຂອງ\n"
"            ການຂາຍຍ່ອຍດ້ານກະສິກຳ, ຮອງຮັບທັງການຂາຍສິນຄ້າກະສິກຳແບບ <b>B2B ແລະ B2C</b>. "
"ເຊິ່ງ\n"
"            ກວມເອົາການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ <b>ລະບົບໜ້າຮ້ານ (POS) ແລະ ເວັບໄຊ</b>, ພ້ອມໝວດໝູ່ທີ່ເປັນລ"
"ະບຽບຮຽບຮ້ອຍ\n"
"            ເຊັ່ນ: <b>ແກ່ນພັນ, ຢາປາບສັດຕູພືດ, ທາດອາຫານພືດ ແລະ ອຸປະກອນ</b>."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "Three Quick Things to Note:"
msgstr "3 ສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຄວນຮູ້:"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"To get a rapid understanding of the processes this Odoo\n"
"            package offers, you can execute the following flows and "
"configure the settings to suit\n"
"            your Agricultural Store."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃຈຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງແພັກເກດ Odoo\n"
"            ນີ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ, ທ່ານສາມາດທົດລອງປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນລຸ່ມນີ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບ\n"
"            ຮ້ານຄ້າກະສິກຳຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"To start an order in your Point of\n"
"                Sale (POS) session, scan or select all items. For products "
"sold by weight (grams or\n"
"                kilograms), a window will pop up automatically. Enter the "
"specific weight, and the\n"
"                final price will be calculated immediately.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຂາຍໃນຮອບການຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານ (POS)\n"
"                ຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ສະແກນ ຫຼື ເລືອກລາຍການສິນຄ້າທັງໝົດ. ສຳລັບສິນຄ້າທີ່ຂາຍຕາມນ້ຳໜັກ (ກຣ"
"າມ ຫຼື\n"
"                ກິໂລກຣາມ), ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໃຫ້ປ້ອນນ້ຳໜັກຕົວຈິງ, ແລ້ວລະບົ"
"ບ\n"
"                ຈະຄິດໄລ່ລາຄາສຸດທ້າຍໃຫ້ທັນທີ.<br/>"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.template,name:agriculture_shop.product_product_5_product_template
#: model:website.menu,name:agriculture_shop.website_menu_19
msgid "Tomato Seeds"
msgstr "ແກ່ນໝາກເລັ່ນ"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.template,description_sale:agriculture_shop.product_product_5_product_template
msgid ""
"Tomato seeds are the foundation of vibrant home gardens and lush farms, "
"holding the potential to grow into a diverse array of delicious and "
"nutritious tomato plants. From classic red varieties to unique colors and "
"shapes, these seeds offer the joy of cultivating fresh and flavorful "
"tomatoes."
msgstr ""
"ແກ່ນໝາກເລັ່ນແມ່ນພື້ນຖານຂອງສວນຄົວ ແລະ ຟາມທີ່ຂຽວສົດງົດງາມ, ສາມາດເຕີບໃຫຍ່ເປັນຕົ້ນໝາກເລັ່ນທີ່ແຊບ ແລະ "
"ມີຄຸນຄ່າທາງອາຫານຫຼາກຫຼາຍຊະນິດ. ຕັ້ງແຕ່ສາຍພັນສີແດງດັ້ງເດີມ ຈົນເຖິງສີສັນ ແລະ ຮູບຊົງທີ່ແປກຕາ, ແກ່ນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈ"
"ະມອບຄວາມເພີດເພີນໃນການປູກໝາກເລັ່ນທີ່ສົດໃໝ່ ແລະ ມີລົດຊາດແຊບ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.pricing
msgid "Unlimited CRM power and support"
msgstr "ປະສິດທິພາບ CRM ແລະ ບໍລິການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອແບບບໍ່ຈຳກັດ"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.pricing
msgid "Unlimited customization"
msgstr "ປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ແບບບໍ່ຈຳກັດ"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <b>Website &gt; Configuration</b> menu to enable all your "
"transaction options."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ເມນູ <b>ເວັບໄຊ &gt; ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</b> ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກການເຮັດທຸລະກຳທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "Use these settings to tailor the experience for your B2B clients:"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງປະສົບການໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບລູກຄ້າ B2B ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.template,name:agriculture_shop.product_product_12_product_template
msgid "Vermi Compost - Powder"
msgstr "Vermi Compost - ຝຸ່ນບົ່ມຂີ້ກະເດືອນແບບຝຸ່ນ"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:website.menu,name:agriculture_shop.website_menu_18
msgid "Vermi Compost Powder"
msgstr "ຝຸ່ນບົ່ມຂີ້ກະເດືອນແບບຝຸ່ນ"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.template,description_sale:agriculture_shop.product_product_12_product_template
msgid ""
"Vermi Compost Powder is a nutrient-rich organic fertilizer created through "
"the natural process of composting with earthworms. This fine powder is "
"teeming with beneficial microorganisms and essential nutrients, enhancing "
"soil fertility and promoting healthy plant growth when applied to gardens "
"and crops."
msgstr ""
"ຝຸ່ນບົ່ມຂີ້ກະເດືອນແບບຝຸ່ນ ເປັນຝຸ່ນອິນຊີທີ່ອຸດົມດ້ວຍທາດອາຫານ ເຊິ່ງຜະລິດຜ່ານຂະບວນການທຳມະຊາດໂດຍການໃຊ້ຂີ້ກະ"
"ເດືອນ. ຝຸ່ນລະອຽດນີ້ເຕັມໄປດ້ວຍຈຸລິນຊີທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດ ແລະ ທາດອາຫານທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມອຸດົມສົມບູນຂອງດິ"
"ນ ແລະ ສົ່ງເສີມໃຫ້ພືດເຕີບໃຫຍ່ຢ່າງແຂງແຮງ ເມື່ອນຳໄປໃຊ້ໃນສວນ ແລະ ແປງປູກ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.soil_guard_vermi_compost_powder
msgid ""
"Vermicompost powder is a nutrient-rich organic fertilizer produced through "
"vermicomposting. This process involves introducing composting worms to a "
"controlled environment, where they consume and break down organic waste "
"materials such as kitchen scraps and plant debris. As the worms digest the "
"waste, it undergoes microbial decomposition, resulting in nutrient-rich worm "
"castings. These castings are collected, separated from the bedding, and then "
"dried to an appropriate moisture level."
msgstr ""
"ຝຸ່ນບົ່ມຂີ້ກະເດືອນແບບຝຸ່ນ ເປັນຝຸ່ນອິນຊີທີ່ອຸດົມດ້ວຍທາດອາຫານ ເຊິ່ງຜະລິດຜ່ານການລ້ຽງຂີ້ກະເດືອນຍ່ອຍສະຫຼາຍ. ຂະບ"
"ວນການນີ້ເລີ່ມຈາກການນຳຂີ້ກະເດືອນມາລ້ຽງໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຄວບຄຸມ, ໃຫ້ພວກມັນກິນ ແລະ ຍ່ອຍເສດອາຫານ ລ"
"ວມທັງເສດພືດ. ເມື່ອຂີ້ກະເດືອນຍ່ອຍເສດເຫຼືອເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ, ຈະເກີດການຍ່ອຍສະຫຼາຍໂດຍຈຸລິນຊີ ກາຍເປັນມູນຂີ້ກະເດືອນທີ່"
"ອຸດົມດ້ວຍທາດອາຫານ. ຈາກນັ້ນຈະເກັບມູນຂີ້ກະເດືອນ, ແຍກອອກຈາກວັດສະດຸຮອງພື້ນ, ແລ້ວນຳໄປຕາກໃຫ້ແຫ້ງໃນລະ"
"ດັບຄວາມຊຸ່ມທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "Want to do more?"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການເຮັດຫຍັງເພີ່ມເຕີມຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.template,name:agriculture_shop.product_product_15_product_template
msgid "Warrior - Pesticide"
msgstr "Warrior - ຢາປາບສັດຕູພືດ"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.template,description_sale:agriculture_shop.product_product_15_product_template
msgid ""
"Warrior is a potent pesticide renowned for its targeted control of various "
"pests. With its powerful formulation, it offers effective protection to "
"crops by combating harmful insects, ensuring healthier and more productive "
"plants."
msgstr ""
"Warrior ເປັນຢາປາບສັດຕູພືດທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງ ໂດດເດັ່ນໃນການກຳຈັດສັດຕູພືດໄດ້ຢ່າງກົງຈຸດ. ດ້ວຍສູດທີ່ເຂັ້ມຂຸ້"
"ນ, ມັນຊ່ວຍປົກປ້ອງຜົນລະປູກໂດຍການກຳຈັດແມງໄມ້ທີ່ເປັນອັນຕະລາຍ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ຕົ້ນພືດແຂງແຮງ ແລະ ໃຫ້ຜົນຜະລິດສູງ"
"ຂຶ້ນ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:web_tour.tour,rainbow_man_message:agriculture_shop.knowledge_tour
msgid "Welcome! Happy exploring."
msgstr "ຍິນດີຕ້ອນຮັບ! ຂໍໃຫ້ເພີດເພີນກັບການທົດລອງນຳໃຊ້."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "What's Included?"
msgstr "ມີຫຍັງແດ່ລວມຢູ່ນຳ?"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປຶກສາເລື່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Odoo ກັບພວກເຮົາ ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມບໍ່?"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.attribute.value,name:agriculture_shop.product_attribute_value_1
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "ແມ່ນ"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You also have the option to require a <b>down payment</b> initially, with "
"the remainder invoiced later."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຈະຮຽກເກັບ <b>ເງິນມັດຈຳ</b> ກ່ອນໄດ້, ສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອແມ່ນອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on\n"
"            your main dashboard."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງທຸກໆ ແອັບ ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Odoo\n"
"            ໄດ້ຢູ່ໜ້າກະດານຫຼັກ (Dashboard) ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can choose in the settings to <b>invoice either before or after "
"delivery</b>."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ວ່າ ຈະ <b>ອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນກ່ອນ ຫຼື ຫຼັງການຈັດສົ່ງ</b>."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can easily tailor your website to provide the information you want for "
"potential leads."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງເວັບໄຊໄດ້ງ່າຍດາຍ ເພື່ອສະໜອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແກ່ລູກຄ້າທີ່ອາດຈະສົນໃຈ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You didn't import demo data? You can still do it. Go to Apps &gt; Industries "
"&gt;\n"
"                    Upgrade your Agricultural Shop package and select the "
"relevant checkbox"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງເທື່ອບໍ? ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຕອນນີ້. ໄປທີ່ ແອັບ &gt; ກຸ່ມອຸດສາຫະກຳ "
"&gt;\n"
"                    ອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດຮ້ານຄ້າກະສິກຳຂອງທ່ານ ແລ້ວໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຫ້ອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "You have flexibility regarding when to generate invoices:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກກຳນົດເວລາໃນການອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນໄດ້ຢ່າງຍືດຢຸ່ນ:"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Your e-commerce setup involves three main areas: <b>Product\n"
"            Settings</b>, <b>Website-Wide Settings</b>, and <b>Payment &amp; "
"Delivery Methods</b>."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອີຄອມເມີຊຂອງທ່ານປະກອບມີ 3 ພາກສ່ວນຫຼັກຄື: <b>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສິນຄ້າ</b>,\n"
"            <b>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປຂອງເວັບໄຊ</b>, ແລະ <b>ວິທີການຊຳລະເງິນ &amp; ການຈັດສົ່ງ</b>"
"."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.template,name:agriculture_shop.product_product_16_product_template
msgid "Ziram - Pesticide"
msgstr "Ziram - ຢາປາບສັດຕູພືດ"

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model:product.template,description_sale:agriculture_shop.product_product_16_product_template
msgid ""
"Ziram is a trusted pesticide utilized for its broad-spectrum defense against "
"fungi and pests. This protective solution shields plants by inhibiting "
"disease and infestation, contributing to improved crop yield and overall "
"plant health."
msgstr ""
"Ziram ເປັນຢາປາບສັດຕູພືດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມໄວ້ວາງໃຈ ນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນເຊື້ອຣາ ແລະ ສັດຕູພືດໄດ້ຢ່າງກວ້າງຂວາ"
"ງ. ສານປົກປ້ອງນີ້ຊ່ວຍປົກປ້ອງພືດໂດຍການຢັບຢັ້ງພະຍາດ ແລະ ການລະບາດ, ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຜົນຜະລິດ ແລະ ສົ່ງເສີມສຸຂະ"
"ພາບຂອງພືດໂດຍລວມ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"the current setup keeps things simple by using basic product counts to track "
"stock. If you need more power, the <b>Inventory app</b> introduces advanced "
"features like barcode scanning, location tracking, and serial number "
"management."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າປະຈຸບັນເນັ້ນຄວາມລຽບງ່າຍ ໂດຍໃຊ້ການນັບຈຳນວນສິນຄ້າຂັ້ນພື້ນຖານເພື່ອຕິດຕາມສາງ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄ"
"ວາມສາມາດທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນ, <b>ແອັບສາງສິນຄ້າ (Inventory)</b> ຈະມີຄຸນສົມບັດຂັ້ນສູງເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາ ເຊັ່ນ: ການສະ"
"ແກນບາໂຄດ, ການຕິດຕາມສະຖານທີ່ເກັບຮັກສາ, ແລະ ການຄຸ້ມຄອງໝາຍເລກຊີຣຽວ (Serial Number)."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "to improve your website's online visibility and search rankings."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບປຸງການເບິ່ງເຫັນເວັບໄຊຂອງທ່ານໃນໂລກອອນລາຍ ແລະ ອັນດັບການຄົ້ນຫາ."

#. module: agriculture_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agriculture_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "🎓 Website"
msgstr "🎓 ເວັບໄຊ"
